r of Coptic ϣⲁⲩ šau, \"tomcat\", or\n\t\t\t\t\t\tits feminine form suffixed with -t. The Late Latin word ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":345.88,"width":740,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"may be\n\t\t\t\t\t\tderived from another Afro-Asiatic or Nilo-Saharan language. The\n\t\t\t\t\t\tNubian word kaddîska \"wildcat\" ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":369.08,"width":740,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"and Nobiin kadīs are possible sources\n\t\t\t\t\t\tor cognates. The Nubian word may be a loan from Arabic قَطّ‎ qaṭṭ ~\n\t\t\t\t\t\tقِطّ ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":392.28,"width":659.63,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"qiṭṭ. It is \"equally likely that the forms might derive from an\n\t\t\t\t\t\tancient Germanic word, imported into Latin and ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":889.63,"y":392.28,"width":15.33,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"thence to Greek and\n\t\t\t\t\t\tto Syriac and Arabic\".\n\t\t\t\t\t","layout":{"rects":[{"x":904.95,"y":392.28,"width":49.72,"height":19}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"div","layout":{"x":230,"y":484.89,"width":740,"height":139.22},"computed":{"display":"flex","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"element","tag":"figure","layout":{"x":230,"y":484.89,"width":185,"height":139.22},"computed":{"display":"flex","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"element","tag":"img","layout":{"x":230,"y":493.47,"width":170,"height":122.06},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[]}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":415,"y":484.89,"width":555,"height":139.22},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"justify"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe English puss, extended as pussy and pussycat, is attested from\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tthe 16th ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":415,"y":486.89,"width":555,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"century and may have been introduced from Dutch poes or\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfrom Low German ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":415,"y":510.09,"width":555,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"puuskatte, related to Swedish kattepus, or\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNorwegian pus, pusekatt. Similar ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":415,"y":533.3,"width":555,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"forms exist in Lithuanian puižė\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand Irish puisín or puiscín. The etymology of this ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":415,"y":556.5,"width":555,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"word is\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tunknown, but it may have simply arisen from a sound used to\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tattract a ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":415,"y":579.7,"width":555,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"cat.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t","layout":{"rects":[{"x":415,"y":602.91,"width":25.77,"height":19}]}}]}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"section","layout":{"x":200,"y":672.11,"width":800,"height":545},"computed":{"display":"flex","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"element","tag":"article","layout":{"x":200,"y":672.11,"width":440,"height":545},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"center"},"children":[{"nodeType":"element","tag":"h2","layout":{"x":230,"y":700.11,"width":380,"height":23.2},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"center"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"Life span","layout":{"rects":[{"x":350.73,"y":687.11,"width":138.52,"height":49}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":230,"y":753.31,"width":380,"height":348.05},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"justify"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"\n\t\t\t\t\t\tReliable information on the lifespans of domestic cats ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":755.31,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"is varied and\n\t\t\t\t\t\tlimited. Nevertheless, a number of studies ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":778.52,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"have investigated the\n\t\t\t\t\t\tmatter and have come up with ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":801.72,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"noteworthy estimates. The average\n\t\t\t\t\t\tlifespan of pet cats ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":824.92,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"has risen in recent decades. In the early\n\t\t\t\t\t\t1980s, it was ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":848.13,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"about seven years, rising to 9.4 years in 1995 and\n\t\t\t\t\t\tabout ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":871.33,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"15 years in 2021. Some cats have been reported as ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":894.53,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"surviving\n\t\t\t\t\t\tinto their 30s, with the oldest known cat, ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":917.73,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"Creme Puff, dying at a\n\t\t\t\t\t\tage of 38. Neutering increases ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":940.94,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"life expectancy: one study found\n\t\t\t\t\t\tcastrated male cats ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":964.14,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"live twice as long as intact males, while spayed\n\t\t\t\t\t\tfemale ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":987.34,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"cats live 62% longer than intact females. The life ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":1010.55,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"expectancy\n\t\t\t\t\t\tof a cat that is living indoors is typically ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":1033.75,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"about 16.9 years, while\n\t\t\t\t\t\tthe life expectancy of one living ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":1056.95,"width":380,"height":19}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"outdoors is 5.6 years.\n\t\t\t\t\t","layout":{"rects":[{"x":230,"y":1080.16,"width":144.53,"height":19}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"a","layout":{"x":327.84,"y":1119.36,"width":184.3,"height":49.2},"computed":{"display